---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
const updated = "19 July 2026";
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Bvive handles personal information for enquiries, demos and platform use.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy Policy" sub={`Last updated ${updated}`} crumb={{ label: "Home", href: "/" }} />
  <section class="section section--flush-top">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="legalnote">This is a template privacy policy provided as a starting point. It should be reviewed and finalised by {site.name}'s legal advisors before launch, and aligned with the Australian Privacy Principles (APPs) and any applicable obligations.</div>
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>{site.name} ("we", "us") provides a revenue recovery and customer lifecycle platform for recurring-revenue businesses. This policy explains how we collect, use and protect personal information across our website and platform.</p>

        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Contact details you provide through enquiry and demo forms — name, business name, email, phone, industry and customer volume.</li>
          <li>Optional details you choose to share, such as your current payment provider or biggest challenge.</li>
          <li>Standard technical and usage data collected when you visit our website.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How we use information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to enquiries and prepare and run product demonstrations.</li>
          <li>To provide, operate and improve the Bvive platform for customers.</li>
          <li>To communicate relevant updates, where you have chosen to receive them.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Data handled within the platform</h2>
        <p>Where you use Bvive as a customer, you may process information about your own customers. Access is governed by role-based permissions, and you remain responsible for the lawful handling of your customers' information. We support compliant communication workflows but do not provide a guarantee of legal or regulatory compliance.</p>

        <h2>Storage and security</h2>
        <p>We use appropriate access controls and permission settings to protect personal information. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure, and we continue to review our practices.</p>

        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>You can request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information, and can opt out of marketing communications at any time by contacting us.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>For privacy questions, contact us at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legalnote { max-width: 46rem; margin-bottom: var(--sp-7); padding: var(--sp-4) var(--sp-5); background: var(--amber-100); border: 1px solid #f3d79a; border-radius: var(--r-md); font-size: var(--text-sm); color: #8a5a0f; }
</style>
